OL,3,GNEWSAGP surgery told to urgently
OL,4,Aimprove safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FA GP surgery that was rated
OL,7,F"inadequate" following an inspection
OL,8,Flast year has had further urgent safety
OL,9,Fconditions placed on it.
OL,11,FCricklade Surgery, in Wiltshire - which
OL,12,Falso operates a branch in the village
OL,13,Fof Ashton Keynes - serves more than
OL,14,F3,000 people and was already in special
OL,15,Fmeasures.
