OL,3,GNEWSAGP surgery told to urgently
OL,4,Aimprove safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,7,Fserved three warning notices to the
OL,8,Fpractice over regulation breaches in
OL,9,FDecember 2025, but another inspection
OL,10,Fin April showed there were still
OL,11,Fbreaches, leading to it being re-rated
OL,12,Fas "inadequate".
OL,14,FThe surgery says there have been a
OL,15,F"number of positive changes" and the
OL,16,Freport did "not reflect the excellent
OL,17,Fcare that we give our patients".
